{"fps":30,"duration":116.812,"lines":[{"id":"intro","voice":"bolu","text":"Hi! I'm Bolu, the little helper inside AwaazForm.","start":1.4,"end":5.268},{"id":"problem","voice":"bolu","text":"Forms are everywhere. But tiny boxes, confusing words and lots of typing make them hard for many people, especially if you can't see well, can't type easily, or prefer Hindi.","start":5.618,"end":17.561},{"id":"idea","voice":"bolu","text":"AwaazForm lets you fill forms, just by talking. Your voice. Your form. Your access.","start":17.961,"end":24.893},{"id":"loop","voice":"bolu","text":"Every answer goes through the Confidence Loop. I listen, I write down what you said, I check it, and I read it back to you. Nothing is filled until you say yes.","start":25.593,"end":36.191},{"id":"ask","voice":"bolu","text":"Let's try it. What is your date of birth?","start":37.091,"end":40.044},{"id":"answer","voice":"user","text":"Twelve March, nineteen seventy eight.","start":40.344,"end":43.019},{"id":"readback","voice":"bolu","text":"I understand that as the twelfth of March, nineteen seventy eight, and ask: is this right? When you confirm, watch me type it in. Then I double check that it really landed.","start":43.419,"end":55.185},{"id":"timeline","voice":"bolu","text":"Every step I take shows up in the activity list, in plain words. No hidden actions, ever.","start":56.785,"end":63.195},{"id":"pdf","voice":"bolu","text":"Got a printed PDF, like this voter registration form? Upload it. It never leaves your browser. I find the questions, you nudge the boxes into place, and I fill it in. I even tick the right box.","start":63.795,"end":77.99},{"id":"live","voice":"bolu","text":"Want to go hands free? Turn on Live Mode and simply talk. Say yes to confirm, next to move on, or interrupt me any time.","start":79.49,"end":88.18},{"id":"safety","voice":"bolu","text":"Your saved details stay on your device, locked with a passphrase if you like. I never fill passwords or payments, and I never press submit. That choice is always yours.","start":88.98,"end":100.346},{"id":"access","voice":"bolu","text":"Big buttons, high contrast, large text, Hindi, and full keyboard control. Built for everyone.","start":101.046,"end":108.035},{"id":"outro","voice":"bolu","text":"AwaazForm. Your voice. Your form. Your access. Bye bye!","start":108.935,"end":114.412}],"scenes":[{"id":"intro","start":0,"lineStart":1.4,"lineEnd":5.268,"end":5.168},{"id":"problem","start":5.168,"lineStart":5.618,"lineEnd":17.561,"end":17.511},{"id":"idea","start":17.511,"lineStart":17.961,"lineEnd":24.893,"end":25.143},{"id":"loop","start":25.143,"lineStart":25.593,"lineEnd":36.191,"end":36.641},{"id":"demo","start":36.641,"lineStart":37.091,"lineEnd":55.185,"end":56.335},{"id":"timeline","start":56.335,"lineStart":56.785,"lineEnd":63.195,"end":63.345},{"id":"pdf","start":63.345,"lineStart":63.795,"lineEnd":77.99,"end":79.04},{"id":"live","start":79.04,"lineStart":79.49,"lineEnd":88.18,"end":88.53},{"id":"safety","start":88.53,"lineStart":88.98,"lineEnd":100.346,"end":100.596},{"id":"access","start":100.596,"lineStart":101.046,"lineEnd":108.035,"end":108.485},{"id":"outro","start":108.485,"lineStart":108.935,"lineEnd":114.412,"end":116.812}],"cues":{"problem":{"tiny":7.403,"words":8.226,"typing":9.599,"see":14.061,"type":15.159,"hindi":17.15},"idea":{"talking":20.55,"voice":21.97,"form":22.972,"access":23.89},"loop":{"listen":28.706,"write":29.368,"check":31.223,"read":32.283,"yes":33.807},"demo":{"ask":37.09125,"answer":40.3438125,"answerEnd":43.0186875,"readback":43.4186875,"isRight":48.618,"confirm":49.644,"type":50.875,"verify":52.791},"pdf":{"upload":67.766,"local":68.575,"find":70.782,"nudge":72.4,"fill":75.048,"tick":76.078},"live":{"on":81.155,"yes":83.69,"next":85.138,"interrupt":86.586},"safety":{"device":90.265,"lock":91.686,"passwords":94.257,"submit":96.963,"yours":98.451},"access":{"big":101.046,"contrast":102.023,"large":103.15,"hindi":104.052,"keyboard":104.879,"everyone":106.607},"o